# [RATS](../wg/rats.html)

## Summary

The Remote Attestation Procedures (RATS) Working Group held its second session. The meeting addressed updates to active working group documents and individual proposals, focusing on key attestation for hardware security modules, trustworthy credential acquisition, and transparency metadata interchange formats.

